  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-copy-fix",
      "text": "> GitHub: https://github.com/lhh666-6/dsh-copy-fix\n>\n> npm: `dsh-copy-fix`\n\nA profile plugin for DSH that makes the built-in copy buttons work inside the packaged **DSH Desktop** Electron app."
    },
    {
      "section": "Why",
      "text": "The DSH Desktop renderer is sandboxed. In some environments the browser Clipboard API is rejected for programmatic writes, so every copy button appears to do nothing. This plugin:\n\n1. Wraps `navigator.clipboard.writeText`.\n2. First tries the native browser write.\n3. Then POSTs the text to a plugin-owned loopback route.\n4. The Host side writes it through Electron's main-process clipboard.\n5. Finally falls back to `document.execCommand('copy')`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install in a profile",
      "text": "```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "npm (recommended, prebuilt)",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-copy-fix\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-copy-fix"
    },
    {
      "section": "or directly from GitHub",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile desktop add github:lhh666-6/dsh-copy-fix\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:lhh666-6/dsh-copy-fix\n```\n\nThen restart DSH Desktop."
    }
  ],
